{"resourceIdentifier":"5357","resourceName":"TCL Aobo (Tianjin) E-waste recycling and comprehensive utilization project(Phase II)","description":"TCL Aobo (Tianjin) E-waste recycling and comprehensive utilization project(Phase II) aims to produce recycled metals and plastic by recycling E-waste (like waste televisions, washing machines, refrigerators, air conditioners and computers, etc). The project is located in No.10, No.15 Road, Ziya Circular Economy Industrial Park, Jinghai District, Tianjin City, China, and is invested and owned by TCL Aobo (Tianjin) Environmental Protection Development Co., Ltd. \r\nThe project includes disassembly lines for refrigerators, air conditioners, washing machines, LCD TVs, small household appliances, and a deep processing line for products. The most abundant metals in waste electrical and electronic products are steel, aluminium and copper, which are non-renewable resources. The dismantled plastics are mainly ABS and hybrid plastics.\r\nAfter the completion of the project, the annual disassembling and processing capacity of E-waste will be 200,000 tons.","location":{"latitude":38.884999,"longitude":116.801107},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2025-01-03","endExclusive":"2025-02-03","endInclusive":"2025-02-02"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"5357"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Tianjin"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"TCL Aobo (Tianjin) Environmental Protection Development Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Tianjin, China"},{"type":"string","value":"+86-22-60810900"},{"type":"string","value":"wangxiaodan@tcl.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"56817"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"ty